 "observations": [
  "col_left L1: the entry culminatio of p. 382 goes on here. The s of «ascendente» is printed blotted.",
  "col_left L3: «β» and «δ» are Greek; the first e of «stella» is printed blotted.",
  "col_left L15: the m of «em.» is printed broken, the top of its last stroke bent away from the letter like an accent; read em.",
  "col_left L19: «(0)» is the figure zero, of the size and shape of the 0 of 201 in L16 (5.2 by 7.8 points).",
  "col_left L20: «31» is printed upright; a speck at the top right of its 1 is not transcribed.",
  "col_left L21, L22: a blank line separates the names in C from those in D.",
  "col_left L22: the hyphen of «*ad-dabarān*» is printed as a point at mid height.",
  "col_left L23, L24, L26, L31, L35: the marks over the i of «Ḍa‘fī», «*aḍ-ḍafīrah*», «ad-Damīrī» (twice), «*darīǵān*» and «al-ādharī» are bars (2.0-3.5 by 0.8-1.3 points); the dots of the i's of these lines are 1.2-1.7 points and round. Measured with macron_audit.py. «Ḍa‘fī» has the dot under the D and the sign of ‘ayn; «*aḍ-ḍafīrah*» has dots under both d's.",
  "col_left L25, L31: «*dahaǵ*» and «*darīǵān*» are printed with ǵ, Nallino's sign for jīm.",
  "col_left L39: «ecclipticae» is printed so, with a double c (for eclipticae); transcribed as printed.",
  "col_right L1: the entry declinatio Solis of the left column goes on here. The o of «ordines» is printed broken.",
  "col_right L4: the italic 1 of «*31-32*» is printed broken, like l.",
  "col_right L6, L7: the c of «ascendenti» and the second c of «praecipuarum» are printed broken.",
  "col_right L7: the dot of the first i of «declinationes» has a thin spur to the right, joined to it, so that it looks like an acute; read i.",
  "col_right L15: the stem of the d of «dato» is printed with a blob at its foot, joined to the letter and reaching 0.7 point below the baseline; it is not a dot below.",
  "col_right L18: «(excentricus)Lunae» is printed without a space after the parenthesis.",
  "col_right L22, L30: the commas after the second «II» of L22 and after «II» in L30 are printed short (1.4-1.7 by 2.0-2.2 points, 0.6 point below the baseline), like points at low resolution; at 5,000 dpi both have a tail.",
  "col_right L30: the second i of «deiectio» is printed without its dot.",
  "col_right L37: the 0 of «200» is printed broken, only its right side visible.",
  "col_right L41: a speck (0.4 by 0.4 point) between «n.,» and «286» is not transcribed.",
  "col_right L44: the point after the n of «233 n.,» is printed small.",
  "col_right L45: a round speck above the 5 of «254» is not transcribed."
 ],
